  "notes": "AI coding-tool + GenAI-SaaS endpoint detection database (AIM-19; AIM-271 xAI/Grok; AIM-576 provider-api expansion; AIM-595 SaaS refresh; AIM-738 catalogue ownership + drift repair). Domain matching is suffix-based: host == domain or host endswith '.<domain>'. Policy-approved tools (CEO AIM-16): Claude Code, Cursor, Kilo Code. Categories: api (model/tool backend), web (browser product), telemetry, gateway, provider-api (direct LLM provider APIs usable by employee tools AND company-built apps \u2014 AIM-103: application-classified sources do not inherit the employee-tool unapproved verdict). provider-api is the App-LLM metering set (mirrored by apps/api PROVIDER_API_PROVIDERS and guardrail new_sources DEFAULT_PROVIDERS). Ownership: Engineering owns structure/CI drift guards; Security/CEO owns sanctioned flags and policy promotion. Changes via PR; CI fails on JSON or mirror drift.",
